# Cloudflare Pages / Workers static assets.
#
# Do NOT add a Netlify-style SPA catch-all:
#   /*    /index.html   200
# Cloudflare's default HTML handling strips `.html` and `/index` from the
# destination, which then matches `/*` again. Deploy fails with error 100324
# ("Infinite loop detected in this rule").
#
# Prerendered dist/<route>/index.html files are served first via HTML handling
# (same precedence as nginx try_files $uri $uri/index.html). Exact rewrites
# below keep /admin working; Pages does not support [assets] in wrangler.toml.

/admin    /index.html   200
/admin/   /index.html   200
